<% content_for :title, "Pòtay Ajan — Kòd Koneksyon" %>

<div style="font-family:'Inter',Arial,sans-serif; color:#101828;">
  <div style="margin:0 0 10px;">
    <div style="font-family:'Montserrat','Inter',Arial,sans-serif; font-weight:700; font-size:20px; color:#00209F; margin:0;">
      Konekte nan Pòtay Ajan
    </div>
    <div style="margin-top:6px; font-size:13px; color:#475467; line-height:1.6;">
      Sèvi ak kòd sa a pou w konekte nan Pòtay Ajan. Li ekspire nan <strong>10 minit</strong> epi li valid yon sèl fwa.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- CODE CARD -->
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"
         style="margin:14px 0 16px; background:#ffffff; border-radius:14px;
                border:1px solid rgba(0,32,159,0.18); overflow:hidden;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding:14px 14px; background:#f7f9ff;">
        <div style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.6px; color:#344054; text-transform:uppercase;">
          Kòd Yon Fwa
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:8px; font-family:'Orbitron','Montserrat',Arial,sans-serif;
                    font-size:28px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:2px; color:#00209F;">
          <%= @otp %>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="font-size:14px; line-height:1.75; color:#101828;">
    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
      Bonjou <strong><%= @user.first_name %></strong>,
    </p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
      Antre kòd anwo a pou w kontinye koneksyon ou nan Pòtay Ajan.
    </p>

    <p style="margin:0 0 10px;">
      Si w pa t mande kòd sa a, ou ka inyore email sa a.
      Pou èd, kontakte <a href="mailto:support@verifyem.ht" style="color:#00209F; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">support@verifyem.ht</a>.
    </p>

    <p style="margin:14px 0 0; color:#475467;">
      Ekip Sekirite Pòtay Ajan
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
